{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やあ♪?\n皆元気かぃ ´  ・▽・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rottyだよ〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/11/3933231/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおっ ...  クラクラ(´・▽・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた\n可愛い方が隣にっ、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉さん,\nショートヘアーが\n似合うよ(´▽`)ノlove"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーいえば最近美容院に\n行って 髪切ってきたよ*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつだぁ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ そうよ水曜日だっ )))\n昨日 日付かわったから\n一昨日だね(・▽・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言ってもね、\nいつも伸びた分だけ切るから\n4センチとかかなっ*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伸びるペースが早いから\nほっておくと\nめちゃ、長くなっちゃう(⌒‐⌒)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話変わるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜ビブリア古書堂の事件手帖〜\nと言う本が ドラマ化されて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ始まるんだねっ(><)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日テレビ見てたら\n予告流れてきて\n初めて知って\nびっくりした、嬉しかったぁ〜(⌒‐⌒)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれやねん ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ去年に全部読んであって\n『ドラマ化したら結構\n良さそう(・ω・)\nあ、でも主人公のこの女の子に\n合う人ってなったら\nだれやろう?』とか\n１人で考えたりしてたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわっ、!\n『これ ドラマ化されるんだ(>ω<)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、なったんだよねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、剛力あやめさんが、\n主人公のロングヘアーの美人な\n女の人の役で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"剛力あやめさんは\nすごいショートヘアーの人だから\n意外で驚いた(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれが楽しみだなん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、長身の男の人がいるんだけど\nその役をするのは\nEXILEのAKIRAさん★☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ、 ドラマ毎週\n見るぜぃ(*´ω`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜 眠たいぃ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃはそろそろ寝るね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様、おやすみなさい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきだよ(〃ω〃)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーより。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/11/3933231/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}